==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|οὐρητήρ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jʊəˈriːtəɹ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|anatomy}} Either of the two long, narrow [[duct]]s that carry [[urine]] from the [[kidney]]s to the [[urinary bladder]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|ureteral}}
* {{l|en|ureteric}}

